id: pm-89297t
title: Run Git-heavy merge regression files after parallel contract workers
description: "Full failed-log census of Windows nightly run39232112166 at1545d63d shows six30000ms timeouts across both shards: aborted-rebase-recovery(2), lossless-merge-union(1), merge-portability(2), and merge-receipt-settlement(1). PR CI already caps the related native receipt cohort, but complete suites still schedule these files with parallel contract workers. Move all five related Git-heavy files into the existing serial project without changing test membership assertions deadlines retries or shard coverage."
