acceptance_criteria: Each of the five native Git receipt recovery and collection-union spec files is excluded from parallel contracts and included in the existing serial phase; The same partition applies to full tests coverage and nightly sharding with no missing or duplicated membership; All assertions retries test deadlines and workflow job limits remain unchanged; A config-boundary regression detects reintroduction into parallel workers and focused real Git integration tests pass
